  "details": "Moderation & Safety\n\nCurrently, on the VRChat website, when viewing a user’s profile, there is no visible “Report” button under the “More” dropdown or anywhere else on the profile page. This makes it difficult to quickly report problematic users without going back in-game or navigating through other menus.\n\nSolution: \n\nAdd a “Report User” button under the “More” menu on all user profiles.\n\nThe button should open the standard report form, just like in-game.\n\n(Optional) Allow attaching screenshots, links, or additional context when reporting through the website.\n\nThis change would significantly improve moderation efficiency and user safety by making it much easier to report harassment, rule-breaking, or suspicious activity directly from the website.",
